-`σ α ≤ g 4`, and `g 4` is bounded below by no label of `(univ, 3)`; what it forces
-unconditionally is the bottom coupling `A₂c_eq_bot_of_A₁c` (`ω+3 ↦ ω+4`).  The copy `b₁new`'s
